{
 "title": "Conclusion",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Conclusion",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s11b01",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "According to the old *chronicle*, the tribes told the Vikings:",
     "shot": "c10_chronicle",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:chronicle",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b02",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "our land is *great* and rich, but there is no order in it.",
     "shot": "c10_chronicle"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b03",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Twelve centuries later, the *first* half still holds.",
     "shot": "c10_half",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:holds",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b04",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The land is *great* and rich.",
     "shot": "c10_half"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b05",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Russia is still the *largest* country on Earth.",
     "shot": "map:final"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b06",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It survived the *Mongols*.",
     "shot": "c10_survived",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Mongols",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b07",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Drove out the *Poles*.",
     "shot": "c10_survived",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Poles",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b08",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Defeated *Napoleon*.",
     "shot": "c10_survived",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Napoleon",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b09",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And outlasted *Hitler*.",
     "shot": "c10_survived",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Hitler",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b10",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But through all of it, the problem *never* went away.",
     "shot": "c10_problem"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b11",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Russia never had *enough* people for its land.",
     "shot": "c10_problem"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b12",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And too often, its leaders treated people as the *cheapest* resource it had.",
     "shot": "c10_problem"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b13",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "*No* Napoleon is marching toward Moscow now.",
     "shot": "c10_quiet",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b15",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The threat is *quieter*.",
     "shot": "c10_quiet",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b16",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Borders can be *moved*.",
     "shot": "c10_replace",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:moved",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b17",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Territory can be *taken*.",
     "shot": "c10_replace",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:taken",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b18",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Empires can be *rebuilt*.",
     "shot": "c10_replace",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:rebuilt",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b19",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But people take *generations* to replace.",
     "shot": "c10_replace"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b20",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Russia was never going to run out of *land*.",
     "shot": "c10_who",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b21",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The question is *who* will be left to live on it.",
     "shot": "c10_who",
     "quiet": true,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b22",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "*Subscribe* for more documentaries on the countries that shaped our world,",
     "shot": "c10_subscribe",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Subscribe",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b23",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and tell us in the comments: which country should we explore *next*?",
     "shot": "c10_subscribe"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}